# Docker — Technical Standards

<!-- cs: Technické standardy pro psaní Dockerfile a docker-compose.yml -->

## Dockerfile

<!-- cs: Dockerfile -->

### Core Rules

<!-- cs: Základní pravidla -->

- **Never `latest` tag** — always a pinned version: `python:3.12.3-slim`, not `python:latest`.
  <!-- cs: Nikdy latest tag — vždy pinovaná verze: python:3.12.3-slim, ne python:latest. -->
- **Multi-stage builds** — separate build stage from runtime stage; minimize final image size.
  <!-- cs: Multi-stage builds — odděl build fázi od runtime fáze; minimalizuj výsledný image. -->
- **Non-root user** — the application never runs as `root`; create a dedicated user.
  <!-- cs: Non-root user — aplikace nikdy neběží jako root; vytvoř dedikovaného uživatele. -->
- **`.dockerignore`** — every project must have `.dockerignore` (`.git`, `__pycache__`, `node_modules`, `data/`).
  <!-- cs: .dockerignore — každý projekt musí mít .dockerignore (.git, __pycache__, node_modules, data/). -->

### Multi-stage Build Pattern

<!-- cs: Vzor multi-stage buildu -->

```dockerfile
# Stage 1: install dependencies (cached separately from source code)
FROM python:3.12.3-slim AS builder
WORKDIR /app
COPY requirements.txt .
RUN pip install --no-cache-dir --prefix=/install -r requirements.txt

# Stage 2: dev — includes test and lint tools
FROM python:3.12.3-slim AS dev
WORKDIR /app
COPY --from=builder /install /usr/local
RUN pip install --no-cache-dir pytest ruff mypy
COPY . .

# Stage 3: production — lean, no dev tooling
FROM python:3.12.3-slim AS production
WORKDIR /app
COPY --from=builder /install /usr/local
RUN useradd --create-home --shell /bin/bash appuser
USER appuser
COPY --chown=appuser:appuser src/ ./src/
EXPOSE 8000
HEALTHCHECK --interval=30s --timeout=10s --start-period=5s --retries=3 \
  CMD curl -f http://localhost:8000/health || exit 1
CMD ["python", "-m", "uvicorn", "src.api.main:app", "--host", "0.0.0.0", "--port", "8000"]
```

### Cache Optimization

<!-- cs: Cache optimalizace — závislosti před zdrojovým kódem -->

```dockerfile
# ✅ Copy dependencies first — code changes don't invalidate pip cache
COPY requirements.txt .
RUN pip install -r requirements.txt
COPY src/ ./src/

# ❌ Any code change invalidates the entire pip install layer
COPY . .
RUN pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### System Packages — Cleanup

<!-- cs: Systémové balíčky — čistota -->

```dockerfile
RUN apt-get update && apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends \
    curl \
 && apt-get clean \
 && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*
```

## Docker Compose

<!-- cs: Docker Compose -->

- No `version:` field — obsolete since Compose V2.
  <!-- cs: Bez version: fieldu — obsolete od Compose V2. -->
- Secrets and config in `.env` file — never hardcoded in `docker-compose.yml`.
  <!-- cs: Secrets a konfigurace do .env souboru — nikdy hardcodovány v docker-compose.yml. -->
- Restart policy for production services: `restart: unless-stopped`.
  <!-- cs: Restart policy pro produkční služby: restart: unless-stopped. -->
- Named volumes for persistent data; bind mounts only for development hot-reload.
  <!-- cs: Named volumes pro persistentní data; bind mount jen pro development hot-reload. -->
- **npm/pip package added → image must be rebuilt.** Bind mounts only cover `src/`.
  Run `docker compose build <service>` after every `package.json` / `requirements.txt` change.
  <!-- cs: Přidání npm/pip balíčku vyžaduje rebuild image. Bind mounty pokrývají jen src/. Spusť docker compose build <service> po každé změně package.json / requirements.txt. -->

```yaml
services:
  api:
    build:
      context: .
      target: production        # always specify the stage explicitly
    env_file: .env
    ports:
      - "8000:8000"
    depends_on:
      db:
        condition: service_healthy
    restart: unless-stopped

  db:
    image: postgres:16.2-alpine
    environment:
      POSTGRES_DB: ${POSTGRES_DB}
      POSTGRES_USER: ${POSTGRES_USER}
      POSTGRES_PASSWORD: ${POSTGRES_PASSWORD}
    volumes:
      - postgres_data:/var/lib/postgresql/data
    healthcheck:
      test: ["CMD-SHELL", "pg_isready -U ${POSTGRES_USER}"]
      interval: 10s
      timeout: 5s
      retries: 5
    restart: unless-stopped

volumes:
  postgres_data:
```

## Security

<!-- cs: Bezpečnost -->

- Scan image after build: `docker scout cves <image>` or `trivy image <image>`.
  <!-- cs: Scan image po buildu: docker scout cves nebo trivy image. -->
- Never add SSH keys, API tokens, or `.env` with real values into the image.
  <!-- cs: Nikdy nepřidávej SSH klíče, API tokeny ani .env s reálnými hodnotami do image. -->
- Read-only filesystem where possible: `read_only: true` in compose.
  <!-- cs: Read-only filesystem kde je to možné: read_only: true v compose. -->
